==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*bʰewdʰ-}}
{{bor+|ru|cu|блюсти}}, from {{der|ru|sla-pro|*bľusti}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-bsl-pro|*bjaustei}}, from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*bʰewdʰ-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|блюсти́}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|блюсти́|impf|pf=соблюсти́}}

# to [[guard]], to [[keep]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''блюсти́''' [[закон|зако́ны]]|to observe the laws; abide by the laws}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''блюсти́''' [[интерес|интере́сы]]|to watch over the interests}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''блюсти́''' [[поря́док]]|to keep order}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''блюсти́''' [[себя́]]|1) to guard one's chastity; 2) to watch one's waistline; keep in shape}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|impf|7b/b+p|блюсти́|блюд}}

